+# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# Untrusted-data fence (PLAN-178 C6 / ADR-089-AMEND-1 §2)
+# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# The scratchpad is same-plan WRITE by one agent, READ by another — a
+# confused-deputy ingress the read-side hook (#44, cross-plan READ guard)
